<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70909" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νο-ερός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>intellectual,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχαὶ ἀναθυμιώμεναι νοεραὶ ἀεὶ
					γίνονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heraclit.
					12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				1.133c
			</span></i> (v.l., 
				Comp.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῷον ἔμψυχον ν. τε καὶ
				λογικόν,</span> of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόσμος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Zeno Stoic.
				1.32
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				99e
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰσθητικώτερον καὶ-ώτερον τὸ
				λεπτότερον [αἷμα</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				648a3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. τόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					954a35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεῦμα ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Placit.</u>
					1.7.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοεραὶ φρένες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					543
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[θεὸν] νοερώτερον ἠὲ
			νόημα</span> Timo <i><span class="en">
				60
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀσύνετος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.325
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				1.7
			</span></i>; epith. of Apollo, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.525.14
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.6.8
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς</span>
			<i>in the spiritual sense</i> or <i>world,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴθι εἰς Χάρραν ν.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.629
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				1.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>Inst.</u>
				139
			</span></i>; 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοερῷ</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Herm.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				1.49.44
			</span></i>.</div>
